-- THE DEADLINE as a value where the enclosing obligation has no closing
-- edge (refusal 4 of §5.1.1.1, ratified for the value by §2.6 card B1):
-- Alice's obligation has no WITHIN, so there is no deadline to read in its
-- HENCE, however the noun is written.

DECLARE Actor IS ONE OF
    Tenant HAS name IS A STRING

DECLARE Action IS ONE OF
    Sign HAS signer IS AN Actor
    Pay  HAS amount IS A NUMBER

alice MEANS Tenant OF "Alice"

GIVETH A DEONTIC Actor Action
bad MEANS
    PARTY alice MUST Sign alice
    HENCE (PARTY alice MUST Pay 1 WITHIN 0 OF (THE DEADLINE PLUS 5))
